    "group": "Slaanesh’s Chosen",
    "summary": "Your **EMPEROR’S CHILDREN CHARACTER** units can ignore some or all of the modifiers to their M, their [Advance rolls](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move) and their [Charge rolls](vsdata:core-rule/charge-step).\n\nYour **WARLORD**’s unit starts the battle as the Favoured Champions of your army. Whichever player's turn it is, the first time in that turn that one of your **EMPEROR’S CHILDREN CHARACTER** units **destroys** an enemy unit, that **CHARACTER** unit takes over as the Favoured Champions once it has resolved all its attacks.\n\nAttacks by models in your Favoured Champions unit can re-roll their [Wound rolls](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls).",
